      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Nothing was breaking but look -> actually \nactually UMmm... mongoNetwork Error aa rhi \nthi so always after deployment error aae to \ncheck that error on Logs like render pe service ke \nunder logs aate he that will clearly show what's \nwrong (instead of using inspect console, or \nanything else) \n2. i solve MongoNetwork Error by -> adding a \nIP address of 0.0.0.0/0 at the same cluster on \nmongoDB atlas . \n3. and must remember to use real monogURI \nwhile deployment , go create project and then\ncluster and find the uri their and (check and add \n/proj-name  at last if required) \n4. Here -> backend deployed . THEN frontend \nka npm run build kiya and a new folder came dist \nname se and usme se sari files ko public folder \nin backend ke ander copy krdiya then \napp.js me -----> set this _---> ⭐⭐\nconst path = require('path');\n\napp.use(express.static(path.join(__dirname, '../public')));\n\napp.get(\"*name\", (req, res) => {\n    res.sendFile(path.join(__dirname, '../public/index.html'));\n});\n\nthen deploy the latest commit.. \n\nlive link now -->https://chatgpt-lite-xu4t.onrender.com/",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Nothing was breaking but look -> actually \nactually UMmm... mongoNetwork Error aa rhi \nthi so always after deployment error aae to \ncheck that error on Logs like render pe service ke \nunder logs aate he that will clearly show what's \nwrong (instead of using inspect console, or \nanything else) \n2. i solve MongoNetwork Error by -> adding a \nIP address of 0.0.0.0/0 at the same cluster on \nmongoDB atlas . \n3. and must remember to use real monogURI \nwhile deployment , go create project and then\ncluster and find the uri their and (check and add \n/proj-name  at last if required) \n4. Here -> backend deployed . THEN frontend \nka npm run build kiya and a new folder came dist \nname se and usme se sari files ko public folder \nin backend ke ander copy krdiya then \napp.js me -----> set this _---> ⭐⭐\nconst path = require('path');\n\napp.use(express.static(path.join(__dirname, '../public')));\n\napp.get(\"*name\", (req, res) => {\n    res.sendFile(path.join(__dirname, '../public/index.html'));\n});\n\nthen deploy the latest commit.. \n\nlive link now -->https://chatgpt-lite-xu4t.onrender.com/",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
