      "text": "May Be later , i'll have to restart server in future \nthen almost do this \n1. check monogDb atlas pe cluster pause hua ho to\n resume that\n2. AI check karna iff like free na raha ho ab version \nthen only problem can arrive otherwise no issue \nin that case just change model ka naam nothing \nelse.\n3. if pinecone fails then check it on it's web \n4.or if render need a new deployment then do that \ndeploy on latest commit . nothing else.",
